# The release signing key and its passwords.
#
# The debug keystore beside it is committed on purpose and protects nothing.
# This one is the permanent identity of the app on Google Play: a copy in git
# history cannot be taken back, and history outlives whatever the repository's
# visibility happens to be today.
keystore/release.jks
keystore/release.properties
